answer:
Verdict: bug found

Line 16: `pthread_cond_wait(&cv,&m);`

The consumer waits without first testing durable state. A producer that finishes first has already signaled an empty wait set.

| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 |  | lock(m) succeeds | m=B, ready=0 |
| 2 |  | ready = 16 | m=B, ready=16 |
| 3 |  | signal(cv) | no waiter; notification not saved |
| 4 |  | unlock(m) | m=free |
| 5 | lock(m) succeeds |  | m=A, ready=16 |
| 6 | cond_wait: release-and-wait |  | A waits despite completed work; no future signal |

Fix:
```diff
--- prog.c
+++ prog.c (fixed)
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
 }
